# UI: shadcn/ui via `@bokdy/ui`

Interactive UI primitives live in [`packages/ui/src/ui`](packages/ui/src/ui) as **shadcn/ui registry** components (Radix + CVA + Tailwind, New York style). Apps import from `@bokdy/ui` — do not reinvent menus, dialogs, or selects with ad-hoc `useState` + absolute divs.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — hand-rolled dropdown
<button onClick={() => setOpen(!open)} />
{open ? <ul className="absolute …">…</ul> : null}

// ✅ GOOD — compose shadcn Popover + Command + Button (classic combobox)
import { Button, Command, Popover, PopoverContent, PopoverTrigger } from "@bokdy/ui";
```

`packages/ui/src/ui/` must stay **registry-only**. Do not invent new primitives there (no Twemoji wrappers, no all-in-one Combobox with `variant="nav"`). Domain chrome and app compositions belong in:

- `packages/ui/src/common/` — shared chrome used by ≥2 apps (auth shells, `Emoji`, theme script)
- `apps/<app>/components/` — app-only compositions (e.g. admin `PopoverCommandSelect` for locale/theme/filters)

Locale and theme switchers compose Popover + Command with the **nav dropdown layout** in `.cursor/rules/frontend-dropdown-layout.mdc`.

## Conventions

- Add new primitives under `packages/ui/src/ui/` by copying the shadcn New York source; export from `packages/ui/src/index.ts`.
- Prefer existing `@bokdy/ui` exports before copying another design system into an app.
- Semantic status colors go on app wrappers via `className` (Badge variants stay `default | secondary | destructive | outline`).
- Stack freeze: Tailwind + shadcn/ui (Radix) — see `docs/architecture/tech-stack.md` / `AGENTS.md`. Do not introduce Base UI for Combobox.
